        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s4"
      },
      "text": "File name \"Sabiq sot xadimi gulnar abletning qeyin-Qistaqta olgenliki ashkarilanmaqta.doc\" Size 381,667 bytes The .DOC file, which in reality is a \"Single File Web Page\" container, also known as \"Web archive file\", appears to have been created on a system using Microsoft Office - Simplified Chinese.",
