      "text": "Name WINDOWSUPDATANEY.DLL Size 37,888 bytes It is registered as a service (named \"Windowsupdata\") through a Windows Batch file named \"DOT.BAT\" (detected by Kaspersky Lab products as Trojan.BAT.Tiny.b):",
